sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as "Client Browser/Postman"
    participant API as "Express API server.js"
    participant DBConf as "DB Config config/database.js"
    participant ORM as "Sequelize ORM"
    participant PG as "PostgreSQL"
    participant SearchRoute as "Search Route routes/search.js"
    participant MusicAPI as "iTunes Helper config/music.js"
    participant ITunes as "iTunes Search API"
    participant FavRoute as "Favorites Route routes/favorites.js"
    participant FavModel as "Favorite Model models/Favorite.js"

    Note over API,PG: Startup flow
    API->>DBConf: Load env and create Sequelize instance
    API->>DBConf: connectDatabase()
    DBConf->>ORM: sequelize.authenticate()
    ORM->>PG: Open database connection
    PG-->>ORM: Connection OK
    ORM-->>DBConf: Auth success
    DBConf-->>API: Connected
    API->>ORM: sequelize.sync alter true
    ORM->>PG: Sync model and table schema
    PG-->>ORM: Sync complete
    ORM-->>API: Ready
    API-->>User: Server listening on PORT

    Note over User,ITunes: Search flow
    User->>API: GET /api/search q=term
    API->>SearchRoute: Route request
    SearchRoute->>MusicAPI: searchTracks term
    MusicAPI->>ITunes: GET /search term media music limit 10
    ITunes-->>MusicAPI: Raw track results
    MusicAPI-->>SearchRoute: Simplified tracks
    SearchRoute-->>API: query count tracks
    API-->>User: 200 JSON response

    Note over User,PG: Favorites create flow
    User->>API: POST /api/favorites with track payload
    API->>FavRoute: Route request
    FavRoute->>FavRoute: Validate required fields
    FavRoute->>FavModel: findOne by trackId
    FavModel->>ORM: Query duplicate
    ORM->>PG: Select by trackId
    PG-->>ORM: Existing or none
    ORM-->>FavModel: Query result
    alt Duplicate found
        FavModel-->>FavRoute: Existing row
        FavRoute-->>API: 400 Track already in favorites
        API-->>User: 400 JSON error
    else Not duplicate
        FavModel-->>FavRoute: No existing row
        FavRoute->>FavModel: create payload
        FavModel->>ORM: Insert row
        ORM->>PG: Insert into favorites
        PG-->>ORM: Inserted row
        ORM-->>FavModel: Created favorite
        FavModel-->>FavRoute: Created favorite
        FavRoute-->>API: 201 favorite JSON
        API-->>User: 201 JSON response
    end
